  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">RPSC Exam Calendar 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-01-05T14:21:17+05:30\">January 5, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">2:21 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</a>,</strong> has released the<strong> Tentative Exam Calendar</strong>&nbsp;on its&nbsp;<strong>official website</strong> for the <strong>Rajasthan Various Post Examination 2025.</strong> The exam will be conducted on <strong>11 January 2026 To 27 December 2026,</strong> and the last date to submit the application form was<strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"250\">&nbsp;2025</strong>. Candidates can check their&nbsp;<strong>Exam Date /</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Exam Calendar</strong>&nbsp;using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">RPSC Exam Calendar 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">RPSC Various Post Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/rpsc-exam-calendar-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Calendar Available Date :&nbsp;<strong>26 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : 11 January 2026 To 27 December 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <b>RPSC</b>&nbsp;official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">Visit Official Website</span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">RPSC Various Post Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On RPSC Rules</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">Visit Official Website</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>RPSC</strong> provides age relaxation for the<strong> Various Post </strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">N/A</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">RPSC Various Post Recruitment 2026 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 36.7196%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Exam Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 63.2804%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Exam Conducted By</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 36.7196%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">RPSC Various Posts Tentative Exam Calendar 2026</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 63.2804%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC) organize exams regularly.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong> <a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/niacl-apprentices-online-form-2025/\"><strong>NIACL Apprentices Recruitment 2025</strong></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download RPSC Exam Calendar 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the <strong data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"358\">official website of Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"458\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, go to the <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"449\">“Examination Schedule / Exam Calendar / Notifications”</strong> section.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"524\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Look for the notification titled <strong data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"523\">RPSC Exam Calendar 2026</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"573\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the <strong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"559\">Exam Calendar</strong> notification.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"643\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The exam calendar will open in <strong data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"623\">PDF format</strong> or as a <strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"642\">notice</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"763\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Carefully check the <strong data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"736\">dates of all exams, application periods, and important timelines</strong> mentioned in the calendar.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"823\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"789\">Download and save</strong> the exam calendar on your device.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"889\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Take a <strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"847\">printout</strong> if you want a physical copy for planning.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;RPSC Various Post Recruitment 2026 : </span>Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Written Exam</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Interview</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification (DV)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Final Merit List</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our WhatsApp Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our Telegram Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.113%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download Exam Calendar</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.114%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/DF022FF2-717A-4F97-9386-A0EF8942B71A.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-c